  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Fondaparinux is an antithrombotic drug used to treat and prevent blood clots, including pulmonary embolism, thrombosis, thrombophlebitis, and phlebitis. It is an approved antithrombotic, classified among other antithrombotic agents, and has also been studied investigationally.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q27077698\">Wikidata Q27077698</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>fondaparinux</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>B01AX05</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=\"https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB00569\">DB00569</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=\"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/49852292\">49852292</a></td></tr><tr><td>ChEBI:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/searchId.do?chebiId=CHEBI:61033\">61033</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q27077698\">Q27077698</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C31H45N3Na10O49S8+2</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>1730.05 g/mol (PubChem CID 49852292)</td></tr><tr><td>logP:</td><td>-14.7 (Drugs.Common 25.09, not verified)</td></tr></table><p><small>Drugs.Common 25.09 gave 1508.3 g/mol (-12.8 %); replaced by the value above</small></p></body></html>"));
